('marcus-webb','Marcus Webb','Webb Plumbing & Heating','plumber','Bristol','bristol','BS1','Family-run heating and plumbing firm covering Bristol and north Somerset. Boiler installs, full bathroom fits and same-day leak work.',18,42,320,90,'immediate',ARRAY['Boiler installation & servicing','Bathroom installation','Leak detection','Emergency call-out'],1),
('priya-shah','Priya Shah','Shah Electrical','electrician','Manchester','manchester','M1','NICEIC-approved contractor specialising in domestic rewires, EV charge points and landlord certification across Greater Manchester.',11,25,300,120,'immediate',ARRAY['Full & partial rewires','EV charger installation','Consumer unit upgrades','EICR reports'],2),
('tom-halloran','Tom Halloran','Halloran Joinery','carpenter','Leeds','leeds','LS1','Bespoke joinery workshop making fitted wardrobes, staircases and alcove units. Twenty-six years on the tools, mostly period property work.',26,90,340,200,'within_month',ARRAY['Fitted wardrobes & alcoves','Staircases','Doors & second fix','Decking'],3),
('dean-okafor','Dean Okafor','Okafor Build Group','builder','London','london','SE15','Extensions, loft conversions and structural alterations across south London. Directly employed team, no subcontracting.',15,65,480,1800,'within_month',ARRAY['Rear & side extensions','Loft conversions','Structural steels','Full renovations'],1),
('sian-roberts','Siân Roberts','Roberts Roofing','roofer','Cardiff','cardiff','CF10','Third-generation roofers covering South Wales. Slate, tile, flat roofs and full leadwork. Free drone survey on re-roofs.',22,55,300,150,'immediate',ARRAY['Re-roofs & slating','Flat roof systems','Gutter & fascia','Leadwork'],2),
('alan-petrie','Alan Petrie','Petrie Decorating','painter-decorator','Glasgow','glasgow','G1','Careful interior decorating and spray finishing for homes and small commercial jobs. Dust-free sanding as standard.',9,35,240,180,'within_week',ARRAY['Interior decorating','Exterior painting','Wallpapering','Spray finishing'],3),
('kirsty-lam','Kirsty Lam','Lam Tiling','tiler','London','london','E8','Precision tiling for bathrooms, wet rooms and kitchens. Large-format porcelain and natural stone a speciality.',8,30,280,200,'within_week',ARRAY['Bathroom & wet room tiling','Kitchen splashbacks','Large-format porcelain','Natural stone'],2),
('greg-mullen','Greg Mullen','Mullen Plastering','plasterer','Birmingham','birmingham','B1','Skimming, rendering and damp-proof plastering across the West Midlands. Clean, quick and tidy.',14,45,230,150,'immediate',ARRAY['Skimming & re-skims','K-Rend rendering','Coving','Damp-proof plastering'],1),
('nadia-hussain','Nadia Hussain','Hussain Gardens','gardener','Manchester','manchester','M20','Garden design and hard landscaping — patios, fencing, turfing and planting schemes. RHS-trained designer.',12,70,260,80,'within_week',ARRAY['Garden design','Patios & paving','Fencing','Turfing & planting'],2),
('bill-carter','Bill Carter','Carter Home Fixes','handyman','Newcastle','newcastle','NE1','Reliable handyman for the jobs nobody else will take. Flat-pack, shelving, small repairs, minor plumbing.',20,20,180,60,'immediate',ARRAY['Flat-pack assembly','Shelving & mounting','Small repairs','Minor plumbing'],3),
('joe-brennan','Joe Brennan','Brennan Plumbing','plumber','London','london','N4','North London plumber for bathrooms, unvented cylinders and boiler swaps. Gas Safe and Unvented registered.',13,38,340,120,'within_week',ARRAY['Boiler swaps','Unvented cylinders','Bathroom installation','Power flushing'],1),
